    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44272" root="&#xA;                        هذى&#xA;                    " body-key="h1">
                        
                            1
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَذَى</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He talked nonsense; he raved,</i> or
<i>talked irrationally, foolishly,</i> or <i>deliriously;</i>
(JK, K;) <i>by reason of disease or some other
cause.</i> (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَذَىبِهِ</span>
                        <i>He talked irrationally,</i>
&amp;c., <i>with him.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>He mentioned
him,</i> or <i>it, in his irrational,</i> &amp;c., <i>talk.</i> (TA.)

